{"lang": "en", "source_type": "auto_caption", "segments": [{"text": "[Music]", "start": 1.9, "duration": 6.42}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 15.22, "duration": 6.62}, {"text": "The Republic of Sagal is on the western", "start": 19.439, "duration": 5.461}, {"text": "coast of Africa.", "start": 21.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 24.9, "duration": 5.02}, {"text": "Senagal's 9.9 million people occupy an", "start": 26.64, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "area that is around half the size of", "start": 29.92, "duration": 3.11}, {"text": "Japan.", "start": 31.84, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 33.03, "duration": 5.049}, {"text": "The capital Dar and other cities have", "start": 35.44, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "developed commercially", "start": 38.079, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "but living standards are low in the", "start": 40.96, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "villages and income sources were", "start": 42.96, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "extremely limited.", "start": 45.12, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "This is largely because of increasing", "start": 49.52, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "desertification and soil salinity which", "start": 51.36, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "hamper crop growing.", "start": 53.92, "duration": 6.97}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 57.4, "duration": 3.49}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 63.13, "duration": 9.09}, {"text": "We go 250 km southeast from Dar.", "start": 67.76, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 72.22, "duration": 4.66}, {"text": "The economic situation of the people in", "start": 74.799, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the nine villages of the department of", "start": 76.88, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "neorro derip used to be very tough.", "start": 78.799, "duration": 5.081}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 84.12, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "But everything started changing several", "start": 89.68, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "years ago when all the villages", "start": 91.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "participated in a project.", "start": 93.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 97.2, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": ">> Proud of taught me what to do. This", "start": 99.52, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "cloth we dyed is really beautiful. We", "start": 102.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "greatly appreciate what we learned from", "start": 105.52, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Prai.", "start": 107.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": ">> Grass never used to grow here, but it", "start": 109.439, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "does now that we've seated the area.", "start": 112.96, "duration": 6.18}, {"text": "It's made our life that much better.", "start": 116.32, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 119.14, "duration": 4.14}, {"text": ">> Let's explore the PDFI model that helped", "start": 120.799, "duration": 5.051}, {"text": "revitalize these villages.", "start": 123.28, "duration": 9.819}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 125.85, "duration": 7.249}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 137.34, "duration": 4.74}, {"text": "Protei is an acronym for project commun", "start": 138.48, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "development forestia integ. This means", "start": 142.08, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "integrated community forestry", "start": 145.68, "duration": 6.14}, {"text": "development project in English.", "start": 147.599, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 151.82, "duration": 3.38}, {"text": "This project ran for 5 years through", "start": 153.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "January 2005 as a collaboration between", "start": 155.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "the forestry department of Sagal's", "start": 158.72, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Ministry of Environment and the Japan", "start": 160.72, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "International Cooperation Agency.", "start": 162.959, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "The project aims to help villagers", "start": 166.879, "duration": 4.901}, {"text": "revitalize their communities themselves.", "start": 168.879, "duration": 6.051}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 171.78, "duration": 3.15}, {"text": "activity reviews led to the", "start": 175.92, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "transformation of project policies into", "start": 177.599, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "the PREFI model.", "start": 180.16, "duration": 3.799}, {"text": "The PRAFE model starts this action by", "start": 184.159, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "training residents. Training advances to", "start": 186.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the next stage after confirming the", "start": 189.599, "duration": 6.601}, {"text": "opinions and requests of villagers.", "start": 191.76, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "Training under this model is focusing on", "start": 197.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "the following points.", "start": 199.84, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Locally focused.", "start": 202.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Use local resources.", "start": 204.879, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Meet local needs.", "start": 208.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Open attendance", "start": 211.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "for many people.", "start": 214.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "We interviewed Mr. Noda who created the", "start": 217.36, "duration": 5.14}, {"text": "Prafi model.", "start": 220.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 222.5, "duration": 5.62}, {"text": "Africa.", "start": 225.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 230.17, "duration": 3.07}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 247.46, "duration": 10.76}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 261.95, "duration": 6.819}, {"text": "motivation.", "start": 270.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 280.6, "duration": 3.339}, {"text": "The producti model currently covers the", "start": 287.84, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "nine villages of the department of new", "start": 290.0, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "durip.", "start": 292.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The cece family lives in Fili Gawan, one", "start": 294.479, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "of these villages.", "start": 297.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "It would be great to grow mangoes and", "start": 299.759, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "feed them to the family. If we had a lot", "start": 302.4, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "of mangoes, we could sell what the", "start": 305.919, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "family can't consume. Prody staffers", "start": 307.919, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "showed us how to make saplings, so we", "start": 310.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "can do this ourselves now. But we'd like", "start": 312.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "to learn a lot more.", "start": 315.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 317.68, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": ">> The Pradei model employs local resources", "start": 319.84, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "in providing training that meets local", "start": 322.479, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "needs. Around 10 types of training", "start": 324.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "projects are operating under the PREFI", "start": 327.12, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "model.", "start": 329.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "The courses cover such diverse areas", "start": 331.12, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "as nursery,", "start": 334.88, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "aforestation,", "start": 338.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "fruit processing,", "start": 341.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "soil preservation,", "start": 344.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "soap making,", "start": 347.44, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": ">> color dying,", "start": 350.08, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "and chicken and livestock farming.", "start": 352.96, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "Other courses encompass micro financing", "start": 357.919, "duration": 6.761}, {"text": "and planning to support activities.", "start": 360.4, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "In the PDFI model, the theme of the", "start": 365.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "training is decided according to local", "start": 367.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "needs and it can be applied to any", "start": 369.52, "duration": 3.82}, {"text": "region.", "start": 371.84, "duration": 11.119}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 373.34, "duration": 9.619}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 395.31, "duration": 3.129}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 403.67, "duration": 3.06}, {"text": "So,", "start": 414.08, "duration": 2.16}, {"text": "Today friends are visiting Mr. Cece's", "start": 433.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "house. Everyone will go out to do some", "start": 436.24, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "stonework.", "start": 439.199, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "They learned their stonework skills from", "start": 441.28, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "PEI two years ago.", "start": 443.039, "duration": 4.121}, {"text": ">> In this region, it used to be that", "start": 447.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "people could grow nothing because rains", "start": 449.919, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "would flood everything.", "start": 452.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "But that changed when people started", "start": 454.8, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "piling up stones to protect their", "start": 456.8, "duration": 4.18}, {"text": "plantations.", "start": 458.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 460.98, "duration": 5.74}, {"text": ">> Nothing grew here for 5 years.", "start": 463.28, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "But with these stones in place, the", "start": 466.72, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "grass now grows.", "start": 469.199, "duration": 3.641}, {"text": ">> As they pile up stones, Mr. Cay's", "start": 474.0, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "friend, a cattle herder, just walks by.", "start": 476.72, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Life's improved.", "start": 482.639, "duration": 5.141}, {"text": "The foods got better.", "start": 485.199, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 487.78, "duration": 5.3}, {"text": "We can now reap millet.", "start": 489.12, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "There was no grass here until the year", "start": 493.199, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "before. But it started growing last", "start": 495.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "year.", "start": 497.759, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "I think we'll get even more grass if we", "start": 499.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "pile up more stones.", "start": 501.919, "duration": 6.941}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 505.28, "duration": 3.58}, {"text": "Today the village is doing a course on", "start": 509.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "seedling.", "start": 511.28, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "People start gathering before the", "start": 514.0, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "lesson.", "start": 515.68, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Pathfi model training is open to", "start": 517.76, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "everyone in the village including women", "start": 519.599, "duration": 3.971}, {"text": "and children.", "start": 521.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 523.57, "duration": 6.51}, {"text": "Men, women, and children all gather on", "start": 526.48, "duration": 6.18}, {"text": "training days.", "start": 530.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 532.66, "duration": 4.619}, {"text": "I'm convinced we can all move forward", "start": 534.64, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "together.", "start": 537.279, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "The project gives us the knowledge we", "start": 539.04, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "need.", "start": 540.88, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "And people are amassing funds", "start": 542.48, "duration": 2.95}, {"text": "themselves.", "start": 543.92, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 545.43, "duration": 6.089}, {"text": "We all aim to better ourselves.", "start": 547.44, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Prody enables people to learn what", "start": 551.519, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "interests them. That is totally", "start": 554.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "different from the situation before", "start": 557.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the villagers lead in this project.", "start": 560.56, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "And once the project ends, I think", "start": 563.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "people will continue to do things for", "start": 566.64, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "themselves.", "start": 568.959, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 571.84, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "All prodefy model training materials and", "start": 573.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "instructors and other participants are", "start": 576.16, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "from the village or neighboring ones to", "start": 578.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "keep costs low.", "start": 580.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Another benefit is that it is easy for", "start": 583.2, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "noviceses to ask for advice as the", "start": 585.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "instructors live locally.", "start": 587.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "There are people called animators which", "start": 591.519, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "means people to revitalize.", "start": 593.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "They facilitate information exchange by", "start": 596.399, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "acting as a bridge between the Purdafi", "start": 598.8, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "project team and villagers.", "start": 600.88, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "We've had no problems in the two years", "start": 605.44, "duration": 6.35}, {"text": "since we began working with Prod.", "start": 608.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 611.79, "duration": 4.37}, {"text": "We are communicating well with everyone.", "start": 613.2, "duration": 7.319}, {"text": "People are happy to ask us things.", "start": 616.16, "duration": 4.359}, {"text": "Basil Un started working as an animator", "start": 622.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "in 2001 beginning with the forestation", "start": 624.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "activities.", "start": 627.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "The four villages I look after are all", "start": 630.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "doing their best.", "start": 632.8, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "For example, when one village does", "start": 634.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "something, people in other villages see", "start": 636.88, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "what's happening and participate.", "start": 639.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "And it encourages them to do even better", "start": 641.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "themselves.", "start": 643.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "As activities expand, residents begin to", "start": 646.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "sense true unity. Villagers are", "start": 649.36, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "increasingly self-motivated.", "start": 652.0, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Two years have passed since PDFI", "start": 658.72, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "training started.", "start": 660.8, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "The excellence of PDFI training is often", "start": 664.56, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "the center of conversation when people", "start": 666.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "gather, even at wedding parties, and the", "start": 668.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "knowledge travels to neighboring", "start": 671.6, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "villages.", "start": 673.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Today, Bulma Cece will attend a wedding", "start": 676.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "party in a neighboring village.", "start": 679.519, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": ">> I have learned a lot from prony.", "start": 682.72, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "Women can also participate in", "start": 686.64, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "aforestation", "start": 689.279, "duration": 6.201}, {"text": "and sell the trees they grow themselves.", "start": 690.959, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": ">> Madu Jai happened to be at the wedding.", "start": 696.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "In passing, Moisay told him about", "start": 699.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Pradafi model training.", "start": 702.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "I went to Gambia to find work. But I had", "start": 705.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "to return to my village to look after my", "start": 709.68, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "aged father.", "start": 711.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "You can't earn much in Gambia.", "start": 713.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "I think it's better to return home and", "start": 717.04, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "work with your relatives.", "start": 719.92, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "I really sensed that people in this", "start": 725.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "village are united.", "start": 727.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "I heard about prody from Mr. he said and", "start": 729.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "I think it's wonderful", "start": 732.56, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "I'm going to talk about prody with", "start": 734.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "everyone in my village you see when I", "start": 736.959, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "return", "start": 739.519, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 743.31, "duration": 3.1}, {"text": "word of prai will spread from village to", "start": 747.12, "duration": 4.29}, {"text": "village", "start": 749.839, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 751.41, "duration": 4.109}, {"text": "the people of Bullyaki village heard", "start": 753.519, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "about praffi and started participating", "start": 755.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "in training in the neighboring village", "start": 757.92, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "I went to see the neighboring Kool Nala", "start": 762.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "village when training started there.", "start": 764.56, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": ">> I learned even more about Prody.", "start": 768.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "I want to use my knowledge to benefit my", "start": 772.88, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "village.", "start": 775.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I heard they were learning soap making", "start": 778.639, "duration": 4.491}, {"text": "in Kul Nala village.", "start": 780.56, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 783.13, "duration": 3.19}, {"text": "I wanted to participate after seeing", "start": 784.399, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "what they were doing in Kum Nala", "start": 786.32, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "village.", "start": 788.16, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I went to Kul Nala village and saw them", "start": 791.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "growing plants.", "start": 794.639, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 796.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": ">> You really understand things more when", "start": 798.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "you see for yourself.", "start": 800.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "We later started a plantation in Polyoki", "start": 803.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "village.", "start": 805.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "We're improving our knowledge, but we", "start": 807.76, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "want to learn more.", "start": 811.2, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 817.16, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "The past two years have been very", "start": 819.519, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "important for us.", "start": 821.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "You can now see goods produced under the", "start": 823.76, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "Pradei program at a local market.", "start": 826.0, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "We have not done a survey of how much", "start": 830.399, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "the people have gained. But the", "start": 832.399, "duration": 6.761}, {"text": "villagers are very grateful for Prai.", "start": 834.72, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "We can surely say things are clearly", "start": 839.44, "duration": 6.18}, {"text": "different from 2 years ago.", "start": 842.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 845.62, "duration": 4.38}, {"text": "If it weren't for the training, I", "start": 847.76, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "wouldn't know how to make this syrup.", "start": 850.0, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "It's great that I can make things myself", "start": 855.76, "duration": 5.879}, {"text": "from now on.", "start": 858.16, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "In April 2005, Praffi extended the", "start": 864.079, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "project a further 3 years.", "start": 867.519, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The project will provide an environment", "start": 870.639, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "in which residents can continue their", "start": 872.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "efforts under their own steam.", "start": 874.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 877.68, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 887.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Fore!", "start": 889.519, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Foreign! Foreign!", "start": 906.16, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 930.27, "duration": 7.17}, {"text": "Predi has greatly enhanced village", "start": 934.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "living.", "start": 937.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "It is helping build a new future in", "start": 939.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "which people can draw on the knowledge", "start": 942.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "they gain to revitalize their villages", "start": 944.079, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "and it aims to spread its activities to", "start": 948.0, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "many other regions.", "start": 950.56, "duration": 3.719}, {"text": ">> The villagers look forward to harnessing", "start": 956.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "what they learned today to build better", "start": 958.639, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "tomorrows.", "start": 961.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "[Music]", "start": 973.28, "duration": 12.479}, {"text": "[Applause]", "start": 976.28, "duration": 9.479}]}